    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Farrell Auctioneers, Valuers & Estate Agents Ltd. bring to the market this partially demolished fire damaged detached house located at at Sheeaun, Ballysheedy just 4km from Gort town. The property is set on 0.81 acre site and the property extended to 1,475.31 sq. ft.. The property was last occupied in August 2024 and may be applicable for refurbishment grants. There is also a detached garage located on the site.\n\nThe property which is located just 3km to Gort Golf Club and is also just 12km from the seaside village of Kinvara. This property has huge potential for the purchaser to refurbish this property on the mature site in an area which planning permission is hard to obtain. \n\nIMPORTANT NOTICE:\n\nNO INTERNAL VIEWINGS CAN TAKE PLACE AND THERE IS NO ACCCESS TO THE PROPERTY UNLESS ARRANGED WITH OUR OFFICE!!\n\nFor more information, please contact our office on 091 - 632688"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
