        "Content": "<ul><li> Partially demolished fire damaged house </li><li> Set on mature 0.81 Acre Site </li><li> Located approx. 4km from Gort </li><li> Located approx. 12km from seaside village of Kinvara </li><li> Maybe applicable for available grants</li></ul>"
      },
      {
